      "t": "h1",
      "text": "Applications"
    },
    {
      "t": "li",
      "text": "Home"
    },
    {
      "t": "li",
      "text": "Applications"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Our Applications Industries"
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/oil-and-gas-r1fvn5l1vwiti5h45z2whk4r95w9j0ifoazwkspsns.png",
      "alt": "oil and gas",
      "title": "oil and gas",
      "w": "60",
      "h": "60",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Oil and Gas"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Rotary gear pumps ensure efficient transfer of crude oil, refined products, and lubricants in demanding oil and gas operations.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/chemical-r1fvn5l1vwiti5h45z2whk4r95w9j0ifoazwkspsns.png",
      "alt": "chemical",
      "title": "chemical",
      "w": "60",
      "h": "60",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Chemical Processing"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Designed for safe and precise handling of corrosive, viscous, and hazardous chemicals in industrial chemical processing applications.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/pharmaceutical-r1fvn5l1vwiti5h45z2whk4r95w9j0ifoazwkspsns.png",
      "alt": "pharmaceutical",
      "title": "pharmaceutical",
      "w": "60",
      "h": "60",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Pharmaceuticals"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Ideal for hygienic and contamination-free transfer of pharmaceutical liquids, syrups, and sensitive solutions requiring precision and reliability.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/food-and-beverage-r1fvn5l1vwiti5h45z2whk4r95w9j0ifoazwkspsns.png",
      "alt": "food and beverage",
      "title": "food and beverage",
      "w": "60",
      "h": "60",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Food and Beverage"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Ensure safe, hygienic transfer of edible oils, syrups, and dairy products, maintaining quality and taste standards in food processing.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/agriculture-r1fvn5l1vwiti5h45z2whk4r95w9j0ifoazwkspsns.png",
      "alt": "agriculture",
      "title": "agriculture",
      "w": "60",
      "h": "60",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Agriculture"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Efficiently handle pesticides, fertilizers, and other agricultural fluids, ensuring consistent performance in farming and irrigation systems.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/paint-r1fvn5l1vwiti5h45z2whk4r95w9j0ifoazwkspsns.png",
      "alt": "paint",
      "title": "paint",
      "w": "60",
      "h": "60",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Paints and Dyes"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Specialized for transferring highly viscous paints, coatings, and dyes, ensuring smooth flow without contamination or product loss.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/lubrication-r1fvn5l1vwiti5h45z2whk4r95w9j0ifoazwkspsns.png",
      "alt": "lubrication",
      "title": "lubrication",
      "w": "60",
      "h": "60",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Lubrication Systems"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Precisely pump lubricants, oils, and grease in industrial machinery, improving performance and reducing equipment wear and tear.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/cosmetic-industry-r1fvn5l1vwiti5h45z2whk4r95w9j0ifoazwkspsns.png",
      "alt": "cosmetic-industry",
      "title": "cosmetic-industry",
      "w": "60",
      "h": "60",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Cosmetics Industry"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Handle viscous creams, lotions, and liquid products hygienically, ensuring consistency and quality in cosmetics manufacturing processes.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/medical-r1fvn5l1vwiti5h45z2whk4r95w9j0ifoazwkspsns.png",
      "alt": "medical",
      "title": "medical",
      "w": "60",
      "h": "60",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Medical Industry"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Rotary gear pumps ensure precise and hygienic handling of medical fluids, ointments, and solutions, supporting critical healthcare manufacturing processes.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/dairy-industry-r1fvn5l1vwiti5h45z2whk4r95w9j0ifoazwkspsns.png",
      "alt": "dairy-industry",
      "title": "dairy-industry",
      "w": "60",
      "h": "60",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Dairy Industry"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Rotary gear pumps ensure hygienic transfer of milk, cream, yogurt, and other dairy products, maintaining quality and safety standards.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/sugar-r1fvn5l1vwiti5h45z2whk4r95w9j0ifoazwkspsns.png",
      "alt": "sugar",
      "title": "sugar",
      "w": "60",
      "h": "60",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Sugar Industry"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Specialized for handling viscous liquids like syrups and molasses, rotary gear pumps ensure smooth, consistent flow in sugar processing.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/textile-r1fvn5l1vwiti5h45z2whk4r95w9j0ifoazwkspsns.png",
      "alt": "textile",
      "title": "textile",
      "w": "60",
      "h": "60",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h2",
      "text": "Textile Industry"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Efficiently handle dyes, chemicals, and lubricants used in textile manufacturing, ensuring precise application and smooth operations.",
      "html": null
    }
